Title

Improve Design of Prop Type List Default Value Selection Using React Select

Description

Currently, the Prop Type list default value selection is displayed using a basic UI design, which does not provide the best user experience.

This ticket proposes improving the design by replacing the existing implementation with React Select to provide a more intuitive and user-friendly dropdown experience. Using React Select will enhance usability with better styling, search capability (if needed), improved accessibility, and consistent behavior across the UI.

The goal of this ticket is purely UI enhancement — no functional logic changes are expected. The default value selection behavior will remain the same; only the visual and interaction design will be improved for better user experience.
